01:00:21.330 --> 01:00:33.480
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, he is such an annoying person to meditate with, seriously. Every time we're finally into it and have quieted our minds, he starts chanting super loudly--
<v Ira Glass>感谢，一如既往，我们节目的共同创始人，托里·马拉蒂亚先生。你知道，他是 meditation 与一个如此讨厌的人，严肃地说。每次我们最终进入它并安静了我们的头脑，他开始大声吟唱——

01:00:33.480 --> 01:00:36.300
<v Jason Houser>This is the deep state. This is the deep state.
<v Jason Houser>这是深层政府。这是深层政府。

01:00:36.300 --> 01:00:40.160
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周带着更多美国生活的故事回来。

